WEBVTT

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.558
A clinical report needs clear hospital identity, patient context and a proper sign-off.

00:00:14.801 --> 00:00:22.826
Start with a fictional discharge summary that already separates the opening letterhead, the repeating patient banner and the closing signature footer.

00:00:28.222 --> 00:00:34.153
Preview the report to check the branded first page, patient details, medicines and footer together.

00:00:35.414 --> 00:00:39.803
The same page structure keeps the report easy to recognize and ready to print.
